      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Boom filly COMEANDSEE (1) was a class above in her resuming win in a heat of this series at Wagga, drawing on the back row and racing three wide without cover before cruising home by 13.5m. Her lone defeat in five starts was when fourth against the boys in the Protostar. All class and will be very hard to stop from the inside draw. HIGHVIEW BONNIE (2) did a good job at the latest appearance when she dug deep and scored by a head in a heat of this series at this circuit and distance. She'll have to lift to match the top pick but a low draw should see another good showing. KVITKA STRIDE (4) is quite consistent and draws better than when fourth at her most recent appearance. DEL LICIOUS (6) draws wider but will be fitter for the fresh effort and had form around a pair of good fillies at her first preparation. Improver.",
